    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'I am bringing this fun arcade game to life in a rouge-like deck builder.


    Throw
    the ball to knock as many clowns to get as many points within a certain amount
    of time. After X amount of round a boss will appear. Between each round, get
    new coins from the arcade worker to help you out during boss fights or rounds.


    Please
    let me know how I can make the gameplay more engaging and fun!'
